    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d518">

                <pb facs="0510" n="498" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg498"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.6211/312: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-12-20T12:00:00+03:00">December 20,
                            1939—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received December 20—11:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1113. The press announces today without comment the arrival in Moscow yesterday
                    of Ritter, the German Plenipotentiary for Economic Matters, and Schnurre,
                    accompanied by an economic delegation including representatives of the German
                    Ministries of National Economy, Agriculture, Foreign Affairs, and a number of
                    experts.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
